{"claims":[{"end":61,"entity":"2022-township-representative:10-008-120-01:1","fields":{"action":["action.promote"],"beneficiary":["beneficiary.indigenous"],"condition":[],"funding":[],"instrument":[],"quantity":[],"schedule":[],"subject":["subject.local-government"],"target":["target.indigenous-culture","target.cultural-heritage"]},"id":"10-008-120-01-1-001","incumbent_plan":false,"method":"模型判讀","passage":"10-008-120-01-1-p1","quote":"發揚原漢民族文化傳承","reason":"主張發揚原住民族與漢人的文化傳承；原住民族文化配原住民族文化，漢人的傳統文化依既有寫法配文化資產，兩個面向各一半；帶動地方繁榮是目的；第四項改善鄉內基礎建設沒有寫出建設項目，不建立主張","review_status":"未經獨立複評","source_type":"bulletin","start":51},{"end":113,"entity":"2022-township-representative:10-008-120-01:1","fields":{"action":["action.strengthen"],"beneficiary":["beneficiary.elderly","beneficiary.people-with-disabilities","beneficiary.women","beneficiary.children"],"condition":[],"funding":[],"instrument":[],"quantity":[],"schedule":[],"subject":["subject.local-government"],"target":["target.social-safety-net"]},"id":"10-008-120-01-1-002","incumbent_plan":false,"method":"模型判讀","passage":"10-008-120-01-1-p1","quote":"督促行政機關加強對老人、身障人士、婦幼之福利照顧","reason":"主張行政機關加強長者、身心障礙者與婦幼的福利照顧；涵蓋多個群體的整體福利，配社會安全網；原文沒有寫出福利項目","review_status":"未經獨立複評","source_type":"bulletin","start":89},{"end":15,"entity":"2022-township-representative:10-008-120-01:2","fields":{"action":["action.improve"],"beneficiary":[],"condition":[],"funding":[],"instrument":[],"quantity":[],"schedule":[],"subject":["subject.local-government"],"target":["target.application-procedures"]},"id":"10-008-120-01-2-001","incumbent_plan":false,"method":"模型判讀","passage":"10-008-120-01-2-p1","quote":"提升行政效率，確保鄉民權益","reason":"主張提升行政效率；依既有寫法行政效率配申辦便民；第二項協調鄉親與機關的問題是參選人自己的服務，第三項爭取經費建設沒有寫出項目，都不建立主張；原文沒有寫出做法","review_status":"未經獨立複評","source_type":"bulletin","start":2},{"end":94,"entity":"2022-township-representative:10-008-120-01:2","fields":{"action":["action.strengthen"],"beneficiary":["beneficiary.elderly","beneficiary.disadvantaged-families"],"condition":[],"funding":["funding.government-budget"],"instrument":[],"quantity":[],"schedule":[],"subject":["subject.local-government"],"target":["target.social-safety-net"]},"id":"10-008-120-01-2-002","incumbent_plan":false,"method":"模型判讀","passage":"10-008-120-01-2-p1","quote":"運用爭取政府及社會資源，加強高齡長者與弱勢鄉民照顧及充實精神生活","reason":"主張運用政府與社會資源加強照顧長者與弱勢鄉民；涵蓋多個群體的照顧，依既有寫法配社會安全網；資源來自政府與社會，財源寫政府預算","review_status":"未經獨立複評","source_type":"bulletin","start":62},{"end":123,"entity":"2022-township-representative:10-008-120-01:2","fields":{"action":["action.promote"],"beneficiary":[],"condition":[],"funding":[],"instrument":[],"quantity":[],"schedule":[],"subject":["subject.local-government"],"target":["target.tourism"]},"id":"10-008-120-01-2-003","incumbent_plan":false,"method":"模型判讀","passage":"10-008-120-01-2-p1","quote":"協助公所再造明德、愛國、自強、豐丘及觀光旅遊共榮圈","reason":"主張協助公所把明德、愛國、自強、豐丘四村營造為觀光旅遊共榮圈；原文沒有寫出做法","review_status":"未經獨立複評","source_type":"bulletin","start":98},{"end":81,"entity":"2022-township-representative:10-008-120-01:4","fields":{"action":["action.develop"],"beneficiary":["beneficiary.farmers"],"condition":[],"funding":[],"instrument":[],"quantity":[],"schedule":[],"subject":["subject.local-government"],"target":["target.tourism"]},"id":"10-008-120-01-4-001","incumbent_plan":false,"method":"模型判讀","passage":"10-008-120-01-4-p1","quote":"建請農業觀光課積極發展觀光農業，增加鄉內收入","reason":"標題「觀光農業向前行」下，主張公所農業觀光課發展觀光農業；依既有寫法觀光農業配觀光；增加收入是目的；第一項是問政態度，第二項督促各課室與質詢工程是參選人自己的監督，沒有寫出建設項目，都不建立主張","review_status":"未經獨立複評","source_type":"bulletin","start":59},{"end":23,"entity":"2022-township-representative:10-008-120-01:5","fields":{"action":["action.strengthen"],"beneficiary":[],"condition":[],"funding":[],"instrument":[],"quantity":[],"schedule":[],"subject":["subject.local-council"],"target":["target.government-spending"]},"id":"10-008-120-01-5-001","incumbent_plan":false,"method":"模型判讀","passage":"10-008-120-01-5-p1","quote":"替鄉民看守每一分公帑","reason":"主張代表會監督公所使用公帑；監督預算是代表會自身的議事，主體寫地方議會；同句的監督施政弊病是問政態度","review_status":"未經獨立複評","source_type":"bulletin","start":13},{"end":55,"entity":"2022-township-representative:10-008-120-01:5","fields":{"action":["action.restore"],"beneficiary":[],"condition":[],"funding":[],"instrument":["instrument.public-provision"],"quantity":[],"schedule":[],"subject":["subject.local-government"],"target":["target.tribal-infrastructure"]},"id":"10-008-120-01-5-002","incumbent_plan":false,"method":"模型判讀","passage":"10-008-120-01-5-p1","quote":"追討己失去的前瞻計畫建設工程，還給自強社區住民該享的生活","reason":"主張爭回自強社區已失去的前瞻計畫建設工程；「己」依轉錄稿照錄；第三項的 2400 萬環境改善經費是在說明同一件事，不另立主張，數字不寫入這則的原文；信義鄉是原住民族地區，社區的環境建設依既有寫法配部落基礎建設","review_status":"未經獨立複評","source_type":"bulletin","start":27},{"end":106,"entity":"2022-township-representative:10-008-120-01:5","fields":{"action":["action.add"],"beneficiary":[],"condition":[],"funding":[],"instrument":["instrument.public-provision"],"quantity":[],"schedule":[],"subject":["subject.local-government"],"target":["target.transport-infrastructure"]},"id":"10-008-120-01-5-003","incumbent_plan":false,"method":"模型判讀","passage":"10-008-120-01-5-p1","quote":"爭取促成外環道能儘速修建，繁榮陳有蘭溪沿線各村","reason":"主張儘速修建外環道，帶動陳有蘭溪沿線各村；依既有寫法外環道屬縣道與市區道路，主體寫地方政府","review_status":"未經獨立複評","source_type":"bulletin","start":83},{"end":123,"entity":"2022-township-representative:10-008-120-01:5","fields":{"action":["action.promote"],"beneficiary":["beneficiary.farmers"],"condition":[],"funding":[],"instrument":[],"quantity":[],"schedule":[],"subject":["subject.local-government"],"target":["target.tourism","target.agri-marketing"]},"id":"10-008-120-01-5-004","incumbent_plan":false,"method":"模型判讀","passage":"10-008-120-01-5-p1","quote":"提昇休閒觀光及農特產之銷售","reason":"主張提升休閒觀光與農特產的銷售；觀光配觀光，農特產銷售配農產運銷，兩個面向各一半；創造收益是目的；同句的遊覽車通行另列主張","review_status":"未經獨立複評","source_type":"bulletin","start":110},{"end":157,"entity":"2022-township-representative:10-008-120-01:5","fields":{"action":["action.improve"],"beneficiary":[],"condition":[],"funding":[],"instrument":[],"quantity":[],"schedule":[],"subject":["subject.local-government"],"target":["target.transport-infrastructure"]},"id":"10-008-120-01-5-005","incumbent_plan":false,"method":"模型判讀","passage":"10-008-120-01-5-p1","quote":"尤其是愛國村、自強村兩村，大型遊覽車才能合法駛達","reason":"主張改善愛國村與自強村的道路，讓大型遊覽車能合法駛入；原文寫的是遊覽車合法駛達的條件，推定為道路的改善，配交通建設；均衡各村發展是目的","review_status":"未經獨立複評","source_type":"bulletin","start":133}],"manifest":{"data_version":"1b43274656c0","election":"2022-township-representative","format":"policy-atlas-dataset-scope","format_version":1,"scope":"2022-township-representative:10-008-120-01"},"mappings":[{"allocation":0.5,"claim":"10-008-120-01-1-001","evidence":"發揚原漢民族文化傳承","facet":"culture.ethnic.indigenous-culture","id":"10-008-120-01-1-001-m1","method":"模型判讀","question":"q.culture.ethnic.indigenous-culture","question_version":1,"reason":"原文方向與增加原住民族文化保存與推廣的投入相同，但沒有寫出具體做法，判為支持","review_status":"未經獨立複評","stance":"stance.support","stance_value":1.0},{"allocation":0.5,"claim":"10-008-120-01-1-001","evidence":"發揚原漢民族文化傳承","facet":"culture.heritage","id":"10-008-120-01-1-001-m2","method":"模型判讀","question":"q.culture.heritage","question_version":1,"reason":"原文方向與增加文化資產保存的投入相同，但沒有寫出具體做法，判為支持","review_status":"未經獨立複評","stance":"stance.support","stance_value":1.0},{"allocation":1.0,"claim":"10-008-120-01-1-002","evidence":"督促行政機關加強對老人、身障人士、婦幼之福利照顧","facet":"welfare.assistance.safety-net","id":"10-008-120-01-1-002-m1","method":"模型判讀","question":"q.welfare.assistance.safety-net","question_version":1,"reason":"原文「督促行政機關加強對老人、身障人士、婦幼之福利照顧」的方向與擴大社會安全網的服務量能相同，但沒有寫出做法，判為支持","review_status":"未經獨立複評","stance":"stance.support","stance_value":1.0},{"allocation":1.0,"claim":"10-008-120-01-2-001","evidence":"提升行政效率，確保鄉民權益","facet":"governance.application-procedures","id":"10-008-120-01-2-001-m1","method":"模型判讀","question":"q.governance.application-procedures","question_version":1,"reason":"原文方向與簡化民眾的申辦程序、提高辦案效率相同，但沒有寫出具體做法，判為支持","review_status":"未經獨立複評","stance":"stance.support","stance_value":1.0},{"allocation":1.0,"claim":"10-008-120-01-2-002","eviden